# unit_frame_objects_08: the picture-frame objects of bank $08 (08:CA2D-CB97),
# called on object 1 (the player's car) of a Novice race with their fields
# staged (object 1's field +$f is at $7E:20f+1): the five set-ups; the
# cycling steps before and at their count, with the frame stepping past
# and within the frame count, from a shown (bit 7) and an unshown frame,
# and with no record; the swinging step paused, before its count, and at
# it in each direction, stepping and turning.
